# Animated Count Text — an odometer-style number: each digit is a 0-9 column
# sprung to its value; the shuffle button (bottom-right, unlabeled) picks a
# random 1-6 digit number, so digit columns are added/removed with FadeIn /
# FadeOut and the row re-centres with layout transitions.
# What this test covers: single shuffles with the 1 s spring and 800 ms layout
# transition allowed to settle; shuffles fired mid-spring and mid-layout
# (entering/exiting digits interrupted); a long rapid burst of shuffles; a
# press-and-hold on the PressableScale; and a final settle.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/animated-count-text"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1000
# Shuffle button has no accessibility label: tap by position.
press 340 762
wait 1500
press 340 762
wait 1500
press 340 762
wait 1500
# Mid-spring / mid-layout interruptions.
press 340 762
wait 300
press 340 762
wait 300
press 340 762
wait 300
press 340 762
wait 1500
# Rapid burst: digit columns enter/exit while others are still animating.
press 340 762 --count 12 --interval-ms 70
wait 2000
press 340 762 --count 8 --interval-ms 150
wait 2000
# Press and hold (scale-down), release fires one more shuffle.
longpress 340 762 800
wait 1500
press 340 762
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
